# PhysioNet DUA: row-level MIMIC-IV prediction receipts carry note-derived
# reasoning traces / case ids — aggregate scores + manifests are shareable, but
# the per-case receipt jsonls must NEVER be committed.
audit_frozen/mimic_note_experiment/**/predictions_*.jsonl
**/predictions_mimic*.jsonl

